    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a relaxing puzzle-factory game. Use tiles to combine, split and route photons around to solve puzzles and build up your factory in the prepared levels, or create your own levels with the level editor. Bounce photons around and collect them for money, and use the money to make a more efficient factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.poster.avif?t=1739019027\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.webm?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.mp4?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.poster.avif?t=1739019027\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.webm?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.mp4?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a relaxing puzzle-factory game. Use tiles to combine, split and route photons around to solve puzzles and build up your factory in the prepared levels, or create your own levels with the level editor. Bounce photons around and collect them for money, and use the money to make a more efficient factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.poster.avif?t=1739019027\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.webm?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/f2eb5acbbe2eabf16c1952f8676ff3ba.mp4?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.poster.avif?t=1739019027\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.webm?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385260/extras/9f28dfd25785cbab0629f54e314b5182.mp4?t=1739019027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
